    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_temporal_snapshot_manager" kindref="compound">TemporalSnapshotManager</ref></para>
<para>Captures the state of one or more <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_system_versioned_table" kindref="compound">SystemVersionedTable</ref> instances at the moment <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_temporal_snapshot_manager_1a52342661ade0df861a9f6296bf88b0a0" kindref="member">createSnapshot()</ref> is called. Subsequent reads via the handle are isolated from concurrent writes; the snapshot is a deep copy.</para>
<para>Snapshots must be explicitly released (releaseSnapshot) to free memory.</para>
<para>Thread-safety: all public methods are thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
